  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1455672046}
  teacherName: Luu
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 208243415}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1165950374}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 693196828}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Hi, are you here to learn wind magic?
  - "It\u2019s such a versatile skill that can help you achieve your dreams!"
  - Soaring through the sky from place to place with wind magic just feels so romantic.
  - "If you want to master the element like me, you\u2019ll need the control. Try
    to solve this marble maze with only your wind magic."
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - I see. That was well-controlled wind magic.
  - "Well, I suppose now it\u2019s time for me to assess your abilities personally."
  afterBattleLines:
  - Well done!
  - Here is a new spell for you.
  afterSpellLines:
  - "Hm\u2026that\u2026was unusual\u2026"
  - Continue on your journey, MC.
